  oe:hasFact <https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/apixaban> oe:treats <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/deep_vein_thrombosis> ;
  oe:hasFact <https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/metoprolol> oe:treats <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/angina_pectoris> ;
  oe:hasFact <https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/risperidone> oe:treats <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/schizophrenia> .

